### Lỗi 5 — Cố `new T()` hoặc `new T[]`

```java
// ❌ SAI
public class Repo<T> {
    public T taoMoi() {
        return new T();               // ❌ compile error
    }

    public T[] toArray() {
        return new T[10];             // ❌ compile error
    }
}
```

**Vì sao sai:** type erasure — runtime không biết `T` là gì (Phần 3.7).

```java
// ✅ ĐÚNG — truyền factory
public class Repo<T> {
    private final Supplier<T> factory;
    private final Object[] items = new Object[10];

    public Repo(Supplier<T> factory) { this.factory = factory; }

    public T taoMoi() { return factory.get(); }

    @SuppressWarnings("unchecked")
    public T[] toArray(IntFunction<T[]> generator) {
        T[] result = generator.apply(items.length);
        System.arraycopy(items, 0, result, 0, items.length);
        return result;
    }
}

// Dùng:
Repo<Product> repo = new Repo<>(() -> new Product(null, "", BigDecimal.ZERO));
Product[] arr = repo.toArray(Product[]::new);      // ⭐ IntFunction<T[]>
```

